  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.59 “Non-CO2 budget unit” means a unit that does not meet the applicability criteria of Env-A 4601.02.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09 (from Env-A 4602.60); ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.55); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.60)",
